@startuml Rule Group Update
title Update Rule Group Interface Activity Diagram

start

:Receive PUT /api/rule-groups/{groupId} request;
:Parse path parameters and request body RuleGroupQO;

:Validate parameters;
note right: rules cannot be null

if (Parameter validation passed?) then (no)
  :Return 400 error;
  stop
endif

:Call RuleGroupService.updateRuleGroupWithRules();

:Query if rule group exists;
if (Rule group does not exist?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 error;
  stop
endif

:Validate traffic ratios;
note right: Traffic ratios must be integers between 0-100
note right: Sum of all traffic ratios must not exceed 100

if (Traffic ratio validation passed?) then (no)
  :Return 400 error;
  stop
endif

:Query original rules in rule group;

:Iterate new rule list;
:Validate if rule exists;
if (Rule does not exist?) then (yes)
  :Return 400 error;
  stop
endif

:Validate if rule already belongs to other rule group;
note right: Rules in current rule group are excluded

if (Rule belongs to other rule group?) then (yes)
  :Return 400 error;
  stop
endif

:Validate if rule status can transition to AB_TEST;
note right: Allowed status transitions: GRAY -> AB_TEST, FULL -> AB_TEST
note right: If already AB_TEST, ignore

if (Status transition invalid?) then (yes)
  :Throw IllegalArgumentException;
  :Return 400 error;
  stop
endif

:Iterate original rule list;
if (Rule not in new list?) then (yes)
  :Change rule status to OFFLINE;
  :Remove rule from rule group;
endif

:Iterate new rule list;
if (Rule not in original list?) then (yes)
  :Change rule status to AB_TEST;
  :Create RuleGroupRuleRelationEntity;
else (no)
  :Update RuleGroupRuleRelationEntity;
endif

:Set A/B test ratio;
:Update RuleGroupRuleRelationMapper;

:Convert to RuleGroupDTO;
:Return 200 OK;

stop

@enduml
